# Which should you choose?
> Choose Cloud Engineering if you:
Enjoy infrastructure, networking, and cloud platforms.
Want to specialize in AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.
Are interested in cloud architecture and security.

> Choose DevOps Engineering if you:
Enjoy automation and scripting.
Like improving development and deployment workflows.
Want to work with Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and Infrastructure as Code.




Docker Limitation       	Kubernetes Solution
Manual Scaling → Containers manually badhane padte hain.	
Auto Scaling → Pods automatically scale ho jate hain.
No Self-Healing → Container crash ho jaye to khud restart nahi hota.	
Self-Healing → Kubernetes automatically restart kar deta hai.
No Load Balancing → Traffic manually manage karna padta hai.	
Built-in Load Balancer (Service) → Traffic automatically distribute hota hai.
Manual Deployment → Deploy manually karna padta hai.	YAML Deployment → YAML file se deployment automate hota hai.
No Secrets Management → Passwords/keys manage karna difficult hota hai.	
Secrets & ConfigMaps → Passwords aur configs securely store hote hain.
Difficult Networking → Container networking complex hoti hai.	
Built-in Networking → Easy communication between Pods.
No Rolling Updates → Update ke time downtime ho sakta hai.	
Rolling Updates & Rollback → Zero downtime update aur old version par wapas ja sakte hain.